      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "INGEST   -   one safe working copy per scan\nZip: blocks zip-slip, zip bombs, symlinks, absurd sizes.   Git: https only, hooks off, size caps.\nResult: /scan (read-only) and, for a PR, /base. Everything below sees ONE tree, whatever the source was.",
      "originalText": "INGEST   -   one safe working copy per scan\nZip: blocks zip-slip, zip bombs, symlinks, absurd sizes.   Git: https only, hooks off, size caps.\nResult: /scan (read-only) and, for a PR, /base. Everything below sees ONE tree, whatever the source was.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r18",
