      "versionNonce": 247900931,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793353634411,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Fails when a counted finding reaches its limit (defaults, all configurable):\n   vulnerabilities  >= high          secrets  any\n   code issues  >= high              infrastructure  >= high\n   personal data  report only\nAlso fails on:  function complexity (CCN > 15, length > 100, args > 6)\n                          duplication above 5%\nSuppressed or baseline-accepted findings do not count.",
      "originalText": "Fails when a counted finding reaches its limit (defaults, all configurable):\n   vulnerabilities  >= high          secrets  any\n   code issues  >= high              infrastructure  >= high\n   personal data  report only\nAlso fails on:  function complexity (CCN > 15, length > 100, args > 6)\n                          duplication above 5%\nSuppressed or baseline-accepted findings do not count.",
